OL,3,AControlled explosion at Nepali
OL,4,Ahydropower tunnel as rescuers look for
OL,5,A900 missing workers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe number of missing is a sharp rise
OL,8,Ffrom 2,502, which was announced on
OL,9,FSunday
OL,11,FOf those missing, 3,655 are Nepali
OL,12,Fcitizens, with 592 foreigners
OL,13,Funaccounted for
OL,15,FIn Tibet, the official death toll is
OL,16,F16, with 546 reported missing,
OL,17,Faccording to Chinese state media
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
